<title>USA: EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 23-DEC.</title>
<headline>EMERGENCY WEATHER CONDITIONS -  WSC - 23-DEC.</headline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Fern situated at 9.4 north, 140.4 East, in the Philippine Sea is threatening shipping. It is expected to track northward and slowly intensify through Tuesday. It should weaken again after that.  </p>
<p>THERE ARE NO FURTHER EMERGENCY WEATHER STATEMENTS</p>
</text>
